    "result_text": "Both tests pass. Let me verify I haven't left anything inconsistent by confirming the full build succeeded (it did \u2014 tests ran against a fresh build).\n\nThe change is complete and verified. Here's what I implemented as a full-stack, additive change:\n\n**Database** \u2014 `V4__invoices.sql`: new `invoices` table (`id` identity, `project_id` FK \u2192 `projects`, `amount DECIMAL(12,2)`).\n\n**Server (OfficeFloor REST)** \u2014 a new `invoice` package with `Invoice`/`InvoiceRepository`/`NewInvoice`/`InvoiceView`, plus two logic classes and their YAML routes:\n- `GET /api/invoices?projectId=<id>` (`ListInvoices`) \u2014 returns a project's invoices, oldest first.\n- `POST /api/invoices` (`CreateInvoice`) \u2014 validates project + amount, saves via the repository.\n\n**Test seed support** \u2014 extended `TestSupportController` to seed `invoices` (using explicit fixture ids) and to `TRUNCATE ... RESTART IDENTITY` the table on reset (before projects/clients, with referential integrity disabled).\n\n**Front-end** \u2014 extended the Projects feature (kept local, no cross-feature imports): each project row gets a `project-open-<id>` button, and opening one renders a `ProjectDetail` with `project-invoices-table` (`invoice-row-<id>` \u2192 `invoice-amount`, 2-decimal formatting), a `project-invoices-total`, and an add-invoice form (`invoice-form-amount` / `invoice-form-submit`) that posts and reloads.\n\nNo audit records were needed (the spec asserts none), and I didn't touch any pinned scaffolding.",
